      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The process of using Solar Quotes was a quick, efficient & trustworthy experience.I had 2 reputable installers visit my home & provide proposals.After putting the idea of Solar off for many years due to the many bad eggs within the industry,  Solar Quotes were able to help eliminate this.As someone in the construction industry, I did not have the time to review & vet all the installers in the market, instead, I could trust Solar Quotes would provide reputable installers that would complete a professional & reliable system.I opted to go for the smaller retailer in Reward Energy & Cooling.  Doug was very knowledgeable, provide a good product & was honest about the process of solar.He installed on the scheduled day & finished a 7.2 Kw system by 2pm that afternoon. This was all done with an 8 week old baby within the house.So far the system has been performing well and Doug was quick to rectify any commissioning issues that were present.This was a painless experience that was long overdue.Zane.",
