      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "We decided to go with Doug from REC because of his knowledge, experience and his willingness to answer any and all questions without any pressure to secure a sale. We live in Sydney and we’re buying solar for our place in Townsville that we will be moving into early next year.As I imagine like most people buying solar we knew very little about solar, we’d done a fair bit of research online but a lot of the info we found contradicted each other which left us at square one. Doug took the time to answer all our questions and to give us an understanding of how things work and why he uses the products he uses. There was zero pressure to buy or go ahead with REC, Doug just wanted to make sure we had all the information and understanding so we could make an informed decision about solar.Once we decided to go ahead with REC the whole experience was so smooth, being that we live in Sydney Doug had to liaise with our tenants for the install which wasn’t a problem. Our tenants said the team from REC were super friendly and professional, left the place as they found it and walked them through the Enlighten app for monitoring each panel and system performance.Could not fault REC and would recommend them for anyone who wants a Solar.",
